<title>USA: Proffitt's names De Waal vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Proffitt's names De Waal vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Proffitt's Inc said Thursday that Ronald de Waal had been appointed vice chairman of its board.</p>
<p>De Waal is chairman of We International BV, a privately-held Dutch corporation operating more than 250 fashion specialty stores in Europe. Proffitt's said he has served on its board since 1985.</p>
</text>
